{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>《Steam 特賣模擬器》一夕爆紅 完美還原 Steam 買 Game 結帳流程</strong></p><p>・開發者Mike Wing推出《Steam特賣模擬器》<br>・完美還原Steam商店介面及結帳流程<br>・讓玩家虛擬購物無需花費真錢<br>・提供清空購物車的快感體驗<br>・網站累積超過千萬次瀏覽</p><p>暫時未能從HKEPC擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.hkepc.com/26194/Steam_%E7%89%B9%E8%B3%A3%E6%A8%A1%E6%93%AC%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%95%E7%88%86%E7%B4%85_%E5%AE%8C%E7%BE%8E%E9%82%84%E5%8E%9F_Steam_%E8%B2%B7_Game_%E7%B5%90%E5%B8%B3%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T11:59:35.986340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"minimal"}}